    <string name="automation_export_full_capture_summary">On by default. Records this task’s name and prompt, model and tool requests/results, final responses, and failure details. Turning it off stops future capture and clears this task’s stored full details; old entries are not backfilled. Capture mode is fixed when each run is claimed: enabling it after a run starts takes effect on the next run; disabling it immediately stops that run’s capture, and turning it back on never resumes an existing run.</string>
